==Trivia==
*Zroco's Japanese name, Wanibon (ワニボン), may be derived from 鰐 ''wani'' (crocodile), 二分 ''nibun'' (bisection; division into two parts), 盆 ''[[wikipedia:Bon (festival)|Bon]]'' (a Buddhist festival held annually in August to honor the dead) and ''bone''.
*Zroco is one of the only enemies whose species changes between versions: Its English description calls it a gator, while its Japanese description says it's a crocodile.
**Whether it's an alligator or a crocodile, Zroco is anatomically incorrect, although that shouldn't be a surprise given the game's comedic backdrop.
*Zroco has the shortest burrow distance of all burrowing [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]].
*Its English description misspells the word ''dumbbells'' as "dumbells".
*In Greek mythology, the [[wikipedia:Styx River Styx|River Styx]] is a river of misery which draws the line between the underworld and the rest of the world, which is also mentioned in [[Zollow]]'s description and in the name of [[Hannya]]'s first map.
**Zroco also appears in [[Revenge of Carnage (Merciless)|Revenge of Carnage]] to support Hannya.
*In Japanese Buddhist tradition and religious belief, the [[wikipedia:Sanzu River|Sanzu River]] is a river which the souls of the deceased must cross before they can reach the afterlife, which is also mentioned in Zollow's Japanese description and in [[Long Line at Cerberus]]' Japanese name (Wait Three Days at the Sanzu River).

